    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Automate AI Social Media Content Creation and Publishing to Instagram\n\n## Quick overview\nCreate AI-assisted English copy and single-image/carousel assets with a companion studio, then optionally publish to Instagram. This workflow does not create narrated Reels or publish to YouTube.\n\n## How it works\nReserve a job/budget, write and validate copy, request independent review, poll rendering, then evaluate the external publishing gate. Persist Meta action results and publication receipts.\n\n## Setup\n1. Keep this template inactive while configuring it.\n2. Assign your own credentials; remove inherited account associations before sharing.\n3. Install the matching external runtime and persistent storage. The JSON does not include these services.\n4. Configure service URLs, helper paths, HTTPS media routes and target accounts.\n5. Use fictional sample content, neutral colors and assets you own; inspect the rendered output for unwanted branding.\n6. Prove preview/no-publishing behavior before authorizing any live platform test.\n\n## Customization\nChange content, layouts, schedules and timezone in their actual configuration locations. Keep authorization, validation and receipts intact.\n\n## Publishing safety\nManual execution can reach real platform writes. Do not rely on a trigger name, dryRun flag or YouTube privateTest without validating its actual branch/backend behavior. This note does not certify runtime readiness.\n\n## Documentation\n[Setup, testing and operations](https://paoloronco.notion.site/Automate-AI-Social-Media-Content-Creation-and-Publishing-to-Instagram-41af0ba27c3281e7a8c3c9434b6efbbe)",
        "height": 1008,
        "width": 672,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "3cd78259-ae93-4653-b8d4-39ea172b01d3",
      "name": "[TPA] 00 Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1040,
        -384
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Reserve brief and budget\nManual, scheduled and authenticated test inputs share the production path. Reserve before paid calls and inspect canGenerate plus the service response.\n\nThe backend enforces budgets and job reuse. Execution-derived keys alone do not deduplicate separate executions. A test trigger name does not prevent posting.",
        "height": 816,
        "width": 800,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "448b2661-304e-4dca-9227-676c70ba3c10",
      "name": "[TPA] 01 Brief and budget",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -336,
        -384
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Write, review and render\nValidate writer output, facts, novelty and provider usage. The companion service must enforce the intended correction limit and reviewer decision.\n\nPoll until ready; stop on failed/rejected states. Inspect output and licensing manually. AI review is not proof of factual accuracy; previews can incur API costs.",
        "height": 816,
        "width": 2480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "ec8c4fb7-2453-49ef-905f-f92042be1c78",
      "name": "[TPA] 02 Copy review and rendering",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        496,
        -384
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Gated Instagram publication\nKeep previews when publishing is disabled or previewOnly is true. Otherwise claim an action, use your Meta OAuth account and persist the sanitized result before continuing.\n\nReal success needs a persisted media ID/permalink. Verify dry-run behavior in the backend. Reconcile uncertain writes before retrying; do not assume claims guarantee exactly-once delivery.",
        "height": 816,
        "width": 1648,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "7fe823c5-c868-4f45-892d-f2ade7b679ef",
      "name": "[TPA] 03 Gated Instagram publishing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2992,
        -384
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Authorized asset delivery\nValidate job/file and envelope shape, then let the studio verify signature, expiry and exact asset authorization. Return only the requested bytes or unavailable.\n\nExpose the required HTTPS media route, not internal job/admin APIs. Test expired/tampered links; keep secrets and live signed URLs out of screenshots and exports.",
        "height": 544,
        "width": 1008,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c79cdf8b-ea4b-48ab-8960-7b28977b6581",
